    "name": "Half Marathon Training: Half Marathon 3 (HM3)",
    "author": "Hal Higdon",
    "version": "1.0",
    "created_at": null,
    "description": "Introduction: In my latest book, Hal Higdon's Half Marathon Training (published by Human Kinetics), I created several new training programs. Here is one of them: Half Marathon 3 (HM3). HM3 is designed for experienced runners, those of you who have been running for several years, who enjoy running road races between 5-K and the marathon, ... Continue reading \"Half Marathon 3 (HM3)\"",
