        "description": "I plugged races at 5-K and 10-K into the schedule in Weeks 6 and 9. Nothing magic about those distances and those days. Feel free to modify the program based on the local racing schedule. Use races to test your fitness allowing you to predict more accurately your half marathon pace. During race weeks, you run slightly different mileage midweek.",
